SQLite 3.54.0 amalgamation (sqlite3.c, sqlite3.h), public domain (https://sqlite.org/copyright.html).
Source: https://sqlite.org/2026/sqlite-amalgamation-3540000.zip
  (SHA3-256 7b670a62fdfbd672b75fef004cb703c8a3e87d3a5cc7d675b4a08337004a2d93, sqlite.org/download.html)

Compiled by the build hook of package:sqlite3 (`hooks: user_defines: sqlite3: source: source` in the
workspace pubspec.yaml) instead of downloading its prebuilt libraries: the app is built from source
only (COMP-FDR-001, ADR-0009). Keep the version equal to the one package:sqlite3 bundles (its
CHANGELOG) when updating either.
